L504: ## Appendix F Benchmark Construction Pipeline
L505: 
L506: We follow cite78†Huebner et al. (2021) and cite69†Warstadt et al. (2020) and use templates to generate minimal pairs. Instead of sampling words from CDS only, we sample the words from the overlap of the top 5K most frequent words shared between the wiki-100m and baby-100m corpora. Each subcategory has at least two templates as shown in cite288†Table 13 .
